fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266APS","fragment":"\n\tGstH266APS\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266APS\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266APS\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 Adaptation Parameter Set.\nspecifies the type of APS parameters carried in the APS as\nspecified in Table 6.\nprovides an identifier for the APS for reference by other syntax\nelements.\nspecifies whether the APS NAL unit could include\nchroma related syntax elements.\nALF parameters of GstH266ALF when params_type is GST_H266_ALF_APS.\nLMCS parameters of GstH266LMCS when params_type is GST_H266_LMCS_APS.\nscaling list parameters of GstH266ScalingList when params_type is\nGST_H266_SCALING_APS.\nspecifies whether aps_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value and do not affect the decoding\nprocess now.\nwhether this APS is valid.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 Adaptation Parameter Set.\nspecifies the type of APS parameters carried in the APS as\nspecified in Table 6.\nprovides an identifier for the APS for reference by other syntax\nelements.\nspecifies whether the APS NAL unit could include\nchroma related syntax elements.\nspecifies whether aps_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value and do not affect the decoding\nprocess now.\nwhether this APS is valid.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 Adaptation Parameter Set.\nspecifies the type of APS parameters carried in the APS as\nspecified in Table 6.\nprovides an identifier for the APS for reference by other syntax\nelements.\nspecifies whether the APS NAL unit could include\nchroma related syntax elements.\nspecifies whether aps_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value and do not affect the decoding\nprocess now.\nwhether this APS is valid.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});